<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan-Sept trade deficit widens to $1.13 bln.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-Sept trade deficit widens to $1.13 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's trade deficit widened to $1.13 billion in the first nine months of this year from a deficit of $532.4 million in the same period of 1995, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BELARUS MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Sep 96 Jan-Aug 96 Jan-Sep 95</p>
<p>    exports	 ($ million)   3,875.4    3,437.1    3,360.0</p>
<p>    imports			   5,009.9    4,453.0    3,892.4</p>
<p>    trade balance		  -1,134.5   -1,015.9     -532.4</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
